# ArchiveTune — Listen Together server Caddy reverse proxy.
#
# Adapted from BitChord's Listen Together backend deploy files (GPL-3.0):
# https://github.com/kushagrasinghx/BitChord
#
# Caddy terminates TLS and passes WebSockets through untouched. The app then
# connects to wss://listen.example.com (the WebSocket handler answers on any
# path, so wss://listen.example.com/ws works too).

listen.example.com {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}
